msgstr "Opens the Channel List dialog as an inline overlay showing all available channels with their user counts and topics. You can filter channels by name or topic using the search box. Click the Join button next to an open channel to join it directly. Invite-only (+i) channels show a +i badge; when you select one you are not already in, Join changes to Request Access... and opens a knock request dialog. Secret (+s) channels are completely hidden from the list. Private (+p) channels show their name but not their topic. Press Escape or click Close to dismiss the dialog."

